 "id": "c_mi_079",
 "prompt": "On Main Street of a small town, a lively street festival takes place beneath a canopy of string lights and colorful bunting flags stretched between lampposts. Wooden vendor stalls line the sidewalk, each sheltered by fabric tents displaying handmade crafts on souvenir tables beside craft tables with supplies. A food cart with a built-in popcorn machine dispenses fresh popcorn next to an ice cream stand, while a water cooler sits near a generator humming softly. Nearby, a face-paint booth paints smiling children as a musician strums a guitar beside a dancer twirling under a balloon arch. Picnic tables and folding chairs gather friends around chilled lemonade, while festival posters plaster telephone poles and a map kiosk guides visitors toward a first-aid tent and portable restrooms. Park benches along the route hold families watching balloon-clad floats drift by. Trash cans ensure the streets stay clean. There is no skateboard, no car, no office building, no neon sign, and no airplane.",
